  "href": "strategic_game/strategic_game_mixed_nash_equilibrium.html",
  "body_html": "<h1>Mixed Nash Equilibrium</h1>\n<p>A mixed equilibrium of a finite strategic game $G$ is a Nash equilibrium of its\nmixed extension $\\widetilde G$.</p>\n<p>Equivalently, a mixed profile $\\sigma$ is a mixed Nash equilibrium if for every\nplayer $i$ and every pure deviation $t_i\\in S_i$,\n$$\n  \\widetilde g_i(t_i,\\sigma_{-i})\n  \\le\n  \\widetilde g_i(\\sigma_i,\\sigma_{-i}).\n$$</p>",
  "proof_html": null,
